# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of any
# individual clone's core.autocrlf setting. Added Sept 2026 after
# PROJECT_NOTES.md, letters.html, es/letters.html, and
# assets/data/meetings.json all showed up as "modified" on Russ's
# Windows checkout with 1000+ line diffs that were purely CRLF vs LF
# noise (confirmed byte-identical to HEAD once normalized) -- no repo
# history was affected (nothing was ever actually committed with CRLF),
# this just stops it from recurring on the working-tree side.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/media assets: never touch line endings (text=auto already
# detects most of these as binary, but this makes it explicit and
# avoids any auto-detection edge case corrupting them).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.docx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
